    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present 10 Glengarriff Crescent to the market.\n \nThis well proportioned three-bedroom home is ideally situated within a mature and secure gated development in the heart of Dublin 7. Offering bright and spacious accommodation throughout, the property has been well maintained over the years and boasts a B-rated BER.\n \nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall with practical under-stairs storage and attractive decorative features, including ceiling coving and a decorative ceiling rose. To the front of the property is a bright kitchen/breakfast room fitted with a range of kitchen units and enhanced by a box bay window with fitted bench seating and storage drawers. The kitchen also provides space and plumbing for both a washing machine and dryer.\n \nPositioned to the rear is a spacious living/dining room, finished with semi-solid flooring and featuring a gas fire, ceiling coving and direct access to the rear garden.\n \nUpstairs, there are three well proportioned bedrooms, a main bathroom and an ensuite. Bedroom One is a generous double room spanning the full width of the property and benefits from built-in wardrobes and an ensuite. The ensuite is fitted with a WC, wash hand basin and pump assisted shower.\n \nBedroom Two is another spacious double room, complete with built-in wardrobes and a box bay window. Bedroom Three also benefits from built-in wardrobes and laminate flooring.\n \nCompleting the accommodation is the family bathroom, which enjoys natural light from a skylight and is fitted with tiled flooring and tiled splashback, a WC, wash hand basin, bath and pump assisted shower.\n \nThe property enjoys a highly convenient location close to the Royal Canal Greenway, offering excellent walking and cycling routes right on the doorstep. The nearby villages of Phibsborough and Drumcondra are within easy reach and provide an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, independent retailers and everyday amenities.\n \nA wealth of recreational facilities are also nearby, including the Phoenix Park, National Botanic Gardens and Smithfield, while Dublin City Centre is within comfortable walking distance. This superb setting combines the convenience of city living with access to some of Dublin's most popular outdoor amenities.\n \nThe area is exceptionally well connected, with the Luas Cross City line, Drumcondra Train Station and numerous Dublin Bus routes all within easy reach, providing convenient access throughout the city and beyond. A number of key institutions and employers are also located nearby, including the IFSC, Mater Hospital, Temple Street Children's Hospital, Trinity College Dublin, DCU, St. Patrick's Campus and TU Dublin Grangegorman.\n \nCombining excellent transport links, a wealth of local amenities and a highly desirable Dublin 7 setting, this is an ideal location for those seeking both convenience and connectivity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 5.80m x 1.80m\nLaid with laminate flooring, ceiling coving, a ceiling rose and under-stairs storage.\n\nKitchen - 4.40m x 3.40m\nWith fitted kitchen units and a utility area with plumbing for a washing machine and dryer. A box bay window with fitted bench seating and storage.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 4.60m x 6.60m\nSpacious living/dining room with an electric fireplace, ceiling coving, a ceiling rose and direct access to the rear garden.\n\nBedroom One - 4.30m x 4.60m\nLarge double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and the added benefit of an ensuite.\n\nEnsuite - 1.80m x 2.50m\nWith tiled flooring and splashback, comprising a shower, WC and Wash Hand Basin.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.70m x 2.50m\nDouble bedroom featuring a box bay window and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom Three - 3.60m x 2.10m\nWith laminate flooring and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.10m x 1.70m\nWith tiled flooring and tiled splashback, comprising a skylight, WC, Wash Hand basin, bath, and pump assisted shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
