        "Content": "<ul><li>B Rated BER</li><li>Secure gated development with 19 homes</li><li>Condensing Gas Boiler</li><li>Security Alarm</li><li>Three spacious bedrooms</li><li>Box bay windows</li><li>Pump assisted showers to ensuite and main bathroom</li><li>Prime Dublin 7 location</li><li>Excellent transport links including Luas and rail services</ul>"
